  "fabric": {
    "capacityMbps": 128000,
    "kind": "switching fabric",
    "note": "Port switching capacity 128 Gbps (24 x 1G + 4 x 10G, full duplex), forwarding capacity 96 Mpps, GE latency under 5 us and 10GE under 3 us."
  },
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.h3c.com/en/Products_and_Solutions/InterConnect/Switches/Products/Campus_Network/Access/S5130/H3C_S5130S_EI/",
  "notes": "S5130S-EI common platform (Comware 7): box switching capacity 336 Gbps, 256 MB flash / 512 MB SDRAM, IRF2 stacking of up to 9 units, static routes plus RIP and OSPF, 802.1Q VLAN, LACP, STP/RSTP/MSTP, DHCP server, SNMPv1/v2c/v3, NETCONF/gRPC, web UI and CLI. Port layout and PoE totals from the vendor hardware-information page (https://www.h3c.com/en/Support/Resource_Center/EN/Switches/Catalog/S5130S/S5130S-EI/Technical_Documents/Product_Literature/Hardware_Information___Specifications/H3C_S5130S-EI_IG/202306/1867335_294551_0.htm); switching and forwarding figures from the vendor product page (https://www.h3c.com/en/Products_and_Solutions/InterConnect/Switches/Products/Campus_Network/Access/S5130/H3C_S5130S_EI/). Current software line is Comware 7 CMW710, release R6381 listed on the H3C resource centre for this series (https://www.h3c.com/en/Support/Resource_Center/EN/Switches/Catalog/S5130S/S5130S-EI/default.htm). Two fans, 440 x 260 x 43.6 mm, <= 4 kg, 20 W minimum / 235 W maximum draw (PoE 170 W), 80 Gbps maximum stacking bandwidth (the SFP+ ports stack), serial console plus micro USB console."
